      Data: 126|BirdGame.Pattern, Assembly-CSharp
    - Name: text
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Once the world\u2019s largest eagle, native to New Zealand. With a wingspan
        over three meters and talons like a tiger\u2019s claws, it hunted giant moa
        birds. Extinct today, it remains a symbol of lost majesty and primal power."
